# MSBuild reads this file automatically for any project or solution under this
# folder, from msbuild.exe and from "dotnet build"/"dotnet msbuild". Visual
# Studio doesn't read it (it restores on its own). SDK-style projects need a
# NuGet restore before they build, or they fail with NETSDK1004. The pipeline
# builds each plugin with plain "msbuild <csproj>", so restore here.
# Restore doesn't touch packages.config packages (RestorePackagesConfig is off);
# those still come from the packages folder as before. Pass -restore:false to
# skip it (e.g. "msbuild <csproj> -t:Clean -restore:false" with no feed access).
-restore
